db85dce3-b7cd-48a2-99a5-07b92b52a194,Information war,a79224b6-4df1-5b21-83cd-9d1d1c2289a6,the independent,independent.co.uk,http://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/europe/russian-protesters-pelt-turkish-embassy-in-moscow-with-eggs-and-smash-windows-after-jet-downed-a6748326.html,English,25-11-2015,trustworthy,"Become an Independent member to bookmark this article
