5e66f2eb-57eb-4f4c-b414-5a2697358ebb,Baltic states,35e0dab4-3b39-5b38-9fc4-d0282824a983,brusselstimes.com,brusselstimes.com,https://www.brusselstimes.com/all-news/eu-affairs/91903/eu-2021-2027-budget-focus-of-special-european-summit-on-20th-of-february/,English,19-12-2019,trustworthy,"European Council president Charles Michel has called a special European summit on the 20th of February to discuss the EU 2021-2027 budget.
