— RT (@RT_com) May 2, 2017
“Unfortunately, what we see is precisely the opposite. We have seen attempts to interfere in internal political processes in Russia for a very long time,” Putin said.",Russia threatened to use nukes? US commission produces wildest claims in push for military buildup
