f60d295e-7dbd-4dac-89ec-6f0e2191b33d,"War in Ukraine, Invasion of Ukraine, War crimes, Military, fake news",bfad02c1-a504-52c6-8be4-950554b7d945,the independent,independent.co.uk,https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/europe/ukraine-russia-torture-chamber-killing-murder-b2059421.html,English,18-05-2022,trustworthy,"Become an Independent member to bookmark this article
