a9af025c-4825-4710-a8cf-8d377dc4d4dc,"WADA, Doping, Russophobia",91ecab23-e1fe-5abe-ab1d-1abc11c1cbf5,the independent,independent.co.uk,https://www.independent.co.uk/sport/olympics/russia-doping-admit-olympics-cheating-programme-officials-first-time-a7498356.html,English,09-12-2019,trustworthy,"Become an Independent member to bookmark this article
