77c4b00c-20b2-4197-999c-aa1fe580bcb0,"West, Sanctions, security threat, Sviatlana Tsikhanouskaya",a6244617-2a19-5fc1-93ab-5d047732250a,politico,politico.eu,https://www.politico.eu/article/svetlana-tikhanovskaya-belarus-opposition-leader-lithuania/,English,13-06-2021,trustworthy,"Belarusian opposition leader Svetlana Tikhanovskaya arrived in Lithuania overnight and “is safe,” Lithuanian Foreign Minister Linas Linkevičius said Tuesday.
