| East Germany | The USSR ensured the creation of a communist dictatorship led by the Socialist Unity Party and Wilhelm Pieck became its first President. |","Germany's defeat and the aftermath - World War Two and Germany, 1939-1945 - Cambridge OCR A - GCSE History Revision - Cambridge OCR A - BBC Bitesize"
