27febf93-e86c-4b58-9a53-f30f3f4c677a,"Oligarchs, Anti-Russian, Big business, Sovereignty, Sanctions, Russophobia",4d1ac945-b31f-5213-a683-4e99aaead07e,the independent,independent.co.uk,https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/americas/us-politics/trump-russia-sanctions-putin-oleg-deripaska-treasury-department-rusal-en-a8749781.html,English,06-06-2019,trustworthy,"Become an Independent member to bookmark this article
