15334931-c4a2-46d2-a3d4-478812c742e4,"Euro-scepticism, EU disintegration, European Union, Europe",cb090cb1-696a-5a12-8d89-f2191d13ff06,markets insider,markets.businessinsider.com,https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/stocks/10-outrageous-market-predictions-for-2020-outlook-from-saxo-bank-2019-12-1028738004,English,03-12-2019,trustworthy,"- Saxo Bank, a Danish investment bank, published its 10 ""outrageous"" predictions for 2020 on Tuesday.
