14e9c837-aef3-4b07-b8ee-dad0f3bfa26d,"Religion, Ukraine, autocephaly, West, Orthodox Church, Conspiracy theory",3f58a362-fc81-5dcf-adfd-674cc252f4f3,ekathimerini.com,ekathimerini.com,http://www.ekathimerini.com/243987/article/ekathimerini/news/greek-orthodox-church-backs-independence-of-ukrainian-church,English,03-12-2019,trustworthy,"The Church of Greece said Wednesday it supported Ecumenical Patriarch Vartholomaios' right to grant independence to the Orthodox Church of Ukraine in 2018.
