Same-sex adoption in Belarus is illegal.
Intersex infant surgery in Belarus is not banned.
Serving openly in military in Belarus is don't ask, don't tell.
Blood donations by MSMs in Belarus is legal.
Bathroom access in Belarus is partially restricted.
Conversion therapy in Belarus is not banned.
Equal age of consent in Belarus is equal.
