da16bb53-8230-4093-8501-ae65c4a45186,"War in Ukraine, Invasion of Ukraine, Nuclear issues",96bef7bc-dabf-4063-a5d7-fb7773d29bd4,tass,tass.com,https://tass.com/politics/1565645,English,23-01-2023,disinformation,"MOSCOW, January 23. /TASS/. The Ukrainian military stores Western-supplied ammunition, in particular, HIMARS rockets, at nuclear power plants (NPPs), the press office of Russia’s Foreign Intelligence Service (SVR) reported on Monday.
