6092ee23-ee10-4bf6-a586-e11ec8fb9640,"Biological weapons, experiments, Russophobia, Ukraine, War in Ukraine, USSR, laboratory",71e56f80-98f0-5862-b583-008401a53b43,npr,choice.npr.org,https://choice.npr.org/index.html?origin=https://www.npr.org/2022/02/24/1082837866/russia-invades-ukraine-witness,English,07-03-2022,trustworthy,"NPR’s sites use cookies, similar tracking and storage technologies, and information about the device you use to access our sites (together, “cookies”) to enhance your viewing, listening and user experience, personalize content, personalize messages from NPR’s sponsors, provide social media features, and analyze NPR’s traffic. This information is shared with social media, sponsorship, analytics, and other vendors or service providers. See details.
