550b1356-d8a5-4e16-928c-f45046805578,"Joe Biden, Russophobia, Anti-Russian",3fac9406-a873-5366-bae1-feb456c33625,politico,politico.eu,https://www.politico.eu/article/european-council-summit-russia-ukraine-conflict-brussels-luhansk-donetsk/,English,12-12-2021,trustworthy,"The EU on Thursday threatened Russia with ""massive consequences,"" ""severe cost"" and even coordinated sanctions in the event of any ""further aggression against Ukraine,"" according to conclusions adopted during a European Council summit.
