d5dd3026-242f-435c-aec3-544df89c1d79,"false flag, Douma, OPCW, White Helmets, Chemical weapons/attack, Bashar al-Assad",c661803e-a6e9-4429-aa4c-a788ae2e0ae9,rt,rt.com,https://www.rt.com/newsline/485461-syria-opcw-chemical-russia/,English,10-04-2020,disinformation,"Syrian chemical dossier: Russia slams misinformation in OPCW team’s report on alleged Ltamenah incidents in 2017
