7bf09930-6013-45e9-a90c-587d7f983a82,"coronavirus, Anglo-Saxon, Conspiracy theory",045c97b0-a141-5eb4-a861-3f31d735cc7c,www.leadersleague.com,leadersleague.com,https://www.leadersleague.com/en/news/agnelli-family-s-investment-vehicle-buys-italian-media-group-gedi,English,09-04-2020,trustworthy,"Agnelli Family’s Investment Vehicle Buys Italian Media Group GEDI
