91c63a36-5947-40f8-8ea5-44a312ffdd3b,"Energy, Sanctions, Nord Stream 2, Invasion of Ukraine, gas, Economic difficulties",1336005a-d411-5d9c-8612-64b34f674b93,radiofreeeurope/radioliberty,rferl.org,https://www.rferl.org/a/dutch-reduce-russian-gas-campaign/31782700.html,English,05-12-2022,trustworthy,"The Dutch government has launched a campaign urging people to turn down their central heating and take shorter showers to save power in order to reduce the country’s dependence on Russian fuel imports amid spiraling energy costs.
