Our commitment
The Prague Civil Society Centre is committed to ensuring that those that are striving to shape their societies in a positive way have the means to do their work.
Based in Prague, we work in 12 countries across Eastern Europe, the South Caucasus, and Central Asia. We offer a powerful blend of grants, events, and exchanges that provide our partners with a one-stop-hub for their needs.
Designed to operate in the harshest of conditions, we pride ourselves on being a discreet and secure donor. We do everything we can to support those working for more open, free, and democratic futures no matter how far away that may seem today.
