d7eb50ad-7cae-4049-b97b-79b97f589d45,"Natural resources, Anti-Russian, Foreign mercenaries",ed10c627-c821-51cf-83da-dfaa60884072,the moscow times,themoscowtimes.com,https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2020/05/19/britain-us-denounce-russias-role-in-libya-conflict-a70318,English,12-06-2020,trustworthy,"Britain and the United States on Tuesday urged Russia to stop sending mercenaries to the conflict in Libya, after a recent UN report confirmed the presence of Russian and Syrian fighters in the country.
