c1a14d9f-bfb9-41a2-ac77-3d5b3469c311,"January 13, Human rights, Baltic states",53d0512d-23a3-51bd-8c2a-e060f60191dd,lrt.lt,lrt.lt,https://www.lrt.lt/en/news-in-english/19/1107192/lithuania-looks-to-extend-detention-of-politician-accused-of-spying-for-russia,English,24-10-2019,trustworthy,"Lithuania's Prosecutor General's Office has asked for the detention of Algirdas Paleckis, a Lithuanian politician suspected of spying for Russia, to be extended for another three months.
