b9cadddd-9061-48ee-9aff-e38e33cfd7d9,"Freedom of speech, Sputnik, Russophobia, Baltic states",a3b19ad8-46b7-5a44-ad63-8f3d80c34e5a,baltic news network,bnn-news.com,https://bnn-news.com/state-security-service-suspects-seven-of-breach-of-international-sanctions-219480,English,04-12-2020,trustworthy,"Latvia’s State Security Service (VDD) has performed court-sanctioned investigative activities at locations associated with seven people in Riga and its surrounding territories in relation to suspicion of breach of EU sanctions, VDD reports.
