0a3661ff-380c-4994-a0c5-359c5bba6e1f,"Russia's Ministry of Defence, Syrian War",9fa5890f-9341-5fc5-9229-406eae326962,the independent,independent.co.uk,https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/middle-east/syria-hospital-bombings-idlib-un-doctors-russia-assad-attack-a8942076.html,English,17-10-2019,trustworthy,"Become an Independent member to bookmark this article
