227013a1-4698-4758-983a-a5ea8d9c18a1,"West, Russian superiority",0361fc3e-03b8-5a46-89c1-860513566f7b,the independent,independent.co.uk,http://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/interviews/hide-the-pain-harold-meme-gif-interview-model-real-name-arato-andras-thumbs-up-stock-photo-a7835076.html,English,14-10-2017,trustworthy,"Become an Independent member to bookmark this article
