7b15e13e-64d1-4d69-84f5-b10956762226,"European Union, Sanctions",8c31d898-0917-59c1-af4a-dd8812212b80,politico,politi.co,http://politi.co/1QyWpn5,English,16-12-2015,trustworthy,"Italian Prime Minister Matteo Renzi on Thursday stayed firm on blocking a planned extension of the EU’s economic sanctions against Russia, forcing EU governments to discuss the issue at a much higher level next week.
