[1] Skype call with Anna Kupinska (Haifa, Israel), 8 January 2019.
[2] See, for example, Efraim Zuroff, “Eastern Europe: Anti-Semitism in the Wake of Holocaust-Related Issues,” Jewish Political Studies Review, Vol. 17, No. 1-2 (Spring 2005): 63-79.
