2d9a2d00-d55f-4c05-a940-96c82bf80486,"NATO, War in Ukraine, Donbas, Provocation, Russo-Georgian War",e895213a-b091-5682-8013-88ff88aae32d,unian.info,unian.info,https://www.unian.info/war/donbas-ukrainian-military-to-open-fire-only-if-enemy-attacks-fm-kuleba-11379604.html,English,17-04-2021,trustworthy,"Ukrainian Foreign Minister Dmytro Kuleba has said the Armed Forces of Ukraine will open fire in Donbas only if there is a threat or attack by enemy troops.
