Tony Blinken’s ties to Europe are lifelong, deep and personal — and he is a fierce believer in the transatlantic alliance.","9 things to know about Antony Blinken, the next US secretary of state"
ee0d8c25-ba0e-469b-aca9-46f22f1067e0,"Angela Merkel, Crimea",6b8eb582-45fc-56f4-a733-c346f82cc9cc,politico,politico.eu,http://www.politico.eu/article/angela-merkel-europe-needs-coherent-foreign-policy/,English,11-09-2017,trustworthy,"The biggest challenge facing the European Union in the coming years will be to forge a coherent foreign policy, German Chancellor Angela Merkel said in an interview published Sunday.
