ABOUT CURRENT TIME
The Current Time network, a part of Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty (RFE/RL), provides Russian speakers worldwide with an alternative to Kremlin-controlled media, offering live news, robust debate, and fact-based reporting on local, regional, and international issues. Editorially independent, the channel counters pervasive disinformation through daily news programs and a diverse mix of feature and documentary programming.
RFE/RL’s mission is to promote democratic values by providing accurate, uncensored news and open debate in countries where a free press is threatened and disinformation is pervasive. RFE/RL reports the facts, undaunted by pressure. Learn more about RFE/RL here.
