26efb049-e207-40ce-a178-7da62ec1e1be,"NATO, Nuclear issues, Invasion of Ukraine, War in Ukraine",981cb5c7-d5be-5941-97c7-55d67c62ca8e,politico,politico.eu,https://www.politico.eu/article/no-nuclear-hysteria-ukraine-rows-back-on-zelenskyys-preemptive-strike-remarks/,English,18-10-2022,trustworthy,"Ukraine went into damage control mode after remarks by President Volodymyr Zelenskyy were interpreted as him calling for the West to take “preventive strikes” against Russia, prompting a fierce response from Moscow.
