f6036de0-1a3c-4d35-8695-3f4b3faeb6af,"gas, Energy, European Union",16d8a50e-e88b-5ec9-909e-ca5025e86903,pgnig.pl,en.pgnig.pl,http://en.pgnig.pl/news/-/news-list/id/pgnig-and-eru-signed-an-agreement-american-natural-gas-sold-from-poland-to-ukraine/newsGroupId/1910852,English,01-09-2019,trustworthy,"We accompany you on every journey
