3e9f68c0-bfd9-490e-ae84-eec9971ccd38,"West, food, War in Ukraine, Western values, Europe, European values",75da5c13-efe0-5b51-b765-e9951993cdb2,ariana news | bringing afghan news to the world,ariananews.af,https://www.ariananews.af/ukraine-donated-30000-metric-tons-of-wheat-to-afghanistan/,English,27-09-2022,trustworthy,"The Secretary of State of the United States announced the donation of 30,000 tons of Ukrainian wheat to Afghanistan.
