d618c068-72d1-4f4e-a043-e8af20ee459c,"false flag, White Helmets, Propaganda, Chemical weapons/attack, Intelligence services, Bashar al-Assad, Terrorism, Syrian War",ce9865f1-7ea9-5292-93dc-fba5a65b6368,politico,politico.eu,https://www.politico.eu/article/russia-summons-belgian-envoy-over-aleppo-killings/,English,29-03-2019,trustworthy,"Moscow summoned Belgian ambassador on Friday over a claim that Belgian jets killed six civilians near the Syrian city of Aleppo, Russia’s Ministry of Foreign Affairs said in a statement.
