b73d7515-5b55-408a-be82-3407305fa858,"Military, Black Sea, Military exercise",40ba2cb8-ce64-517e-9ce8-f487499adbf4,kyiv post,kyivpost.com,https://www.kyivpost.com/ukraine-politics/20-countries-to-participate-in-sea-breeze-2020-exercise.html,English,07-02-2020,trustworthy,"Twenty countries will participate in the Sea Breeze exercise in 2020, which is traditionally organized by Ukraine and the United States, the State Border Guard Service of Ukraine has said.
“It is important that new participants, such as Japan and South Korea, joined in the exercise this year. The Norwegian Armed Forces will also participate in the ground-based part of the Sea Breeze for the first time,” Ukrainian co-chief of the exercise, First Rank Captain Oleksiy Doskato said.
