f3470a0f-85b1-48d2-aa7c-90aebc171f41,"Euromaidan, Russophobia, Freedom of speech, Censorship",bce77817-e2bd-59bc-b8e7-e14900566c9b,nbc news,nbcnews.com,https://www.nbcnews.com/think/opinion/russia-s-crimea-invasion-was-good-putin-five-years-later-ncna984431,English,31-03-2021,trustworthy,"Five years after annexing Crimea from Ukraine, Russian President Vladimir Putin has celebrated the March 18 takeover by visiting the Black Sea peninsula with great pomp, enveloped in patriotic propaganda. But for many in Russia, watching the festivities was like a scene from “Mad Max: Fury Road” — while the glory is ballyhooed, the reality is scant.
