08b95107-c5c6-4b56-808a-9d6677c3dc6c,"War in Ukraine, Invasion of Ukraine",bfd3e886-4a58-43e9-842c-37eb3b52563a,tass,tass.com,https://tass.com/politics/1619149,English,17-05-2023,disinformation,"MOSCOW, May 17. /TASS/. Russia and Belarus have called on the United States and NATO countries to rethink what they’re doing in terms of escalating tensions in order to end the security crisis.
