Meanwhile, the head of the KlaipÄda LNG service at KlaipÄdos Nafta, ArÅ«nas Molis, said that Russian gas totalled just two percent of all imports over the last five years, and under 10 percent in 2019.
âMost gas arrives from Norway, US and other places,â said Molis, adding the initial goals of the project shouldnât be forgotten.
