3c5bd34d-4475-420f-acff-fadf7d130fff,"Conspiracy theory, War in Ukraine, Anti-Russian, West",43a68ff2-89d5-5148-9fb2-771147be6d3f,cnn,edition.cnn.com,https://edition.cnn.com/2023/05/07/europe/russia-blames-kyiv-blogger-bombing-intl-hnk/index.html,English,06-05-2023,trustworthy,"Russia has blamed the “Kyiv regime” and several Western nations for the bombing of military blogger Zakhar Prilepin’s car on Saturday.
