f90e7fff-9b80-4cb6-8489-82b67f7cea9d,"Provocation, Invasion of Ukraine, false flag",5cb658fd-4da1-5665-a947-760acb441243,abc online,abc.net.au,https://www.abc.net.au/news/2022-11-16/russia-strikes-multiple-ukraine-cities-up-to-100-missiles/101658158,English,15-11-2022,trustworthy,"Russia has rained missiles on cities across Ukraine in a salvo of strikes that follow its humiliating withdrawal from Kherson, even as signs grew that its retreating forces were pulling even further back from the Dnipro River in the south.
Key points:
