b5b72706-4759-4d26-aecd-daed9390a696,"Invasion of Ukraine, food",520956dd-64a4-46fb-a10f-4bb747ce27ee,tass,tass.com,https://tass.com/russia/1457281,English,28-05-2022,disinformation,"MOSCOW, May 28. /TASS/. Russian President Vladimir Putin, in a telephone conversation with his French counterpart Emmanuel Macron and German Chancellor Olaf Scholz, confirmed Moscow's readiness to continue peace talks with Kiev, the Kremlin press service said on Saturday.
