7677b2a2-4fec-481d-ab59-da8b80245809,yellow vests,b02a8feb-b8f4-5e64-b9e3-66d9a78cdd3d,the independent,independent.co.uk,https://www.independent.co.uk/voices/france-protests-yellow-vests-macron-paris-gilet-jaunes-fuel-prices-minimum-wage-a8681366.html,English,13-12-2018,trustworthy,"Become an Independent member to bookmark this article
