9db46800-913c-432d-ae10-e2b4f1dcb3f9,Lugar Laboratory,f8595f07-6080-5ffe-974d-68b2822b5544,civil georgia,civil.ge,https://civil.ge/archives/365113,English,29-09-2020,trustworthy,"On September 3, the Ministry of Internal Affairs of Georgia said “one of the foreign intelligence services” carried out a cyberattack against the Ministry of Health and the Lugar Center on September 1.
