5f753911-c828-4be9-8d38-a021fd98176a,"Military, Military exercise, Lithuanian military, US presence in Europe, Alexander Lukashenko, Foreign mercenaries, Coup",c986a194-a8e7-4105-a3b9-fe33ac506e60,oped news,opednews.com,https://www.opednews.com/articles/Lithuania-trains-mercenari-by-Danielis-Melzinas-Change-Research-Presidential-Poll_Combat_Military_Opposition-200819-939.html,English,19-08-2020,disinformation,"A new training center created in Lithuania (PabradÄ—) with the assistance of the U.S. military to help with organizing protests in Belarus.
