0fba6337-902c-43d2-9115-72d0c92a1e43,"vaccination, coronavirus, health, Biological weapons",cc5d104b-b861-5944-9de8-e0084b68a847,american council on science and health,acsh.org,https://www.acsh.org/news/2021/02/19/no-covid-mrna-vaccine-wont-cause-alzheimers-or-prion-disease-15357,English,02-07-2021,trustworthy,"With the possibility of Robert F. Kennedy, Jr. being involved in health policy in the next administration, vaccination – especially mRNA vaccines – will become a hot topic. Is there anything to fear from an mRNA vaccine?
