It needs to be said that Bellingcat’s founder Eliot Higgins admitted that claiming “Russia is behind the killing of George Floyd to provoke protests and riots is one of the dumbest takes.” It’s also a straw man, because even the media outlets stoking the riots only talk of some “Russian playbook” and sowing discord, and other such vague and unprovable insinuations, just as they’ve done for years with ‘Russiagate.’
""Russia is behind the killing of George Floyd to provoke protests and riots"" has to be one of the dumbest takes on the current situation in the US.
